IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-24`

-- Tests of Article 24. Expected values are written from the text before the run.
-- "immediately" is read as the same day (WITHIN 0 on a clock of whole days); the distributor's own date of making available is an input.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE



§ `Art 24(1): the distributor verifies before making the system available`

-- args: verified the CE marking; verified the declaration of conformity (Article 47) and the instructions for use; verified that the provider complied with Article 16(b) and (c); there is an importer; verified that the importer complied with Article 23(3)
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- No importer: only the provider is verified ("as applicable").
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(1) the distributor has verified, before making the system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Art 24(2): the bar, and informing the provider or the importer`

-- args: the distributor considers or has reason to consider the system not in conformity; the system has been brought into conformity
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor is barred from making the high-risk AI system available on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor is barred from making the high-risk AI system available on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor is barred from making the high-risk AI system available on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor is barred from making the high-risk AI system available on the market` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor is barred from making the high-risk AI system available on the market` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: the risk within the meaning of Article 79(1); there is an importer; informed the provider; informed the importer
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor has informed the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor has informed the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor has informed the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor has informed the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor has informed the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(2) the distributor has informed the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 24(3): storage and transport conditions`

-- args: under the distributor's responsibility; there are storage or transport conditions; the conditions do not jeopardise compliance with Section 2
#ASSERT `Art 24(3) the distributor has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(3) the distributor has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(3) the distributor has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(3) the distributor has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(3) the distributor has ensured that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise the compliance of the system with Section 2` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 24(4): corrective actions and immediate information`

-- args: the distributor considers or has reason to consider the system it made available not in conformity; it took the corrective actions; it ensured the provider, importer or operator takes them
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has taken the corrective actions or ensured that they are taken` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has taken the corrective actions or ensured that they are taken` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has taken the corrective actions or ensured that they are taken` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has taken the corrective actions or ensured that they are taken` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has taken the corrective actions or ensured that they are taken` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has taken the corrective actions or ensured that they are taken` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: the risk; informed the provider or importer; informed the competent authorities; gave details of the non-compliance and the corrective actions
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(4) the distributor has immediately informed the provider or importer and the competent authorities of the risk` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Art 24(5) and (6)`

-- args: a reasoned request; the information and documentation provided
#ASSERT `Art 24(5) the distributor has provided the relevant competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(5) the distributor has provided the relevant competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(5) the distributor has provided the relevant competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(5) the distributor has provided the relevant competent authority the information and documentation upon a reasoned request` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- args: the authorities took an action; the distributor cooperated
#ASSERT `Art 24(6) the distributor has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 24(6) the distributor has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 24(6) the distributor has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 24(6) the distributor has cooperated with the relevant competent authorities` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Traces`

-- Art 24(1): the distributor makes the system available on 12 December 2027 (day 10); verifying on day 10 is in time, on day 11 it is late.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 24(1) the distributor's duty to verify the matters listed in paragraph 1 before making the system available on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Distributor DOES `Art 24(1) verify, before making the high-risk AI system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` AT 10
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 24(1) the distributor's duty to verify the matters listed in paragraph 1 before making the system available on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Distributor DOES `Art 24(1) verify, before making the high-risk AI system available on the market, the matters listed in paragraph 1` AT 11
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 24(1) the distributor's duty to verify the matters listed in paragraph 1 before making the system available on the market` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 24(1) the distributor's duty to verify the matters listed in paragraph 1 before making the system available on the market` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` (Date 12 12 2027) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- Art 24(2): the bar, to the day before the conformity date (12 December 2027, day 10).
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 24(2) the distributor's duty not to make the system available on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE (JUST (Date 12 12 2027)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Distributor DOES `Art 24(2) make the high-risk AI system available on the market` AT 9
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 24(2) the distributor's duty not to make the system available on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE (JUST (Date 12 12 2027)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Distributor DOES `Art 24(2) make the high-risk AI system available on the market` AT 10
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 24(2) the distributor's duty not to make the system available on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Distributor DOES `Art 24(2) make the high-risk AI system available on the market` AT 500
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 24(2) the distributor's duty not to make the system available on the market until it has been brought into conformity` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE NOTHING AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Distributor DOES `Art 24(2) make the high-risk AI system available on the market` AT 3
-- No time limit stated: Art 24(2) second sentence, (3), (4) first sentence, (5), (6).
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 24(2) the distributor's duty to inform the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Distributor DOES `Art 24(2) inform the provider or the importer of the risk` AT 5
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 24(2) the distributor's duty to inform the provider or the importer, as applicable, of the risk` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 24(3) the distributor's duty to ensure that the storage or transport conditions do not jeopardise compliance with Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
